"text":"The native Python `xml` library is vulnerable to XML External Entity (XXE) attacks.  These attacks can leak confidential data and \"XML bombs\" can cause denial of service. Do not use this library to parse untrusted input. Instead  the Python documentation recommends using `defusedxml`."},"properties":{},"ruleId":"python.lang.security.use-defused-xml-parse.use-defused-xml-parse"},{"fingerprints":{"matchBasedId/v1":"a2ce6f1831ad778c5bd25b0fb5daf34f4d6fb51b6085d61feb33df22d65d22719eae69f30c6bc9d8c3a43e591d90edd7dec1cfcf349262ab5482303a4c61896c_0"},"locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"testcode/BenchmarkTest00142.py","uriBaseId":"%SRCROOT%"},"region":{"endColumn":24,"endLine":58,"snippet":{"text":"\t\thash = hashlib.sha1()"},"startColumn":10,"startLine":58}}}],"message":{"text":"Detected SHA1 hash algorithm which is considered insecure. SHA1 is not collision resistant and is therefore not suitable as a cryptographic signature. Use SHA256 or SHA3 instead."},"properties":{},"ruleId":"python.lang.security.insecure-hash-algorithms.insecure-hash-algorithm-sha1"},{"fingerprints":{"matchBasedId/v1":"d291766faafc3b2ab18b2f809a7911389ebd0ce17d11a3058487f1edadfd978fb90f362d3e8b1cac9adebcb99de64e05183437baade06e2ac3f9761a12f310b1_0"},"locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"testcode/BenchmarkTest00143.py","uriBaseId":"%SRCROOT%"},"region":{"endColumn":24,"endLine":54,"snippet":{"text":"\t\thash = hashlib.sha1()"},"startColumn":10,"startLine":54}}}],"message":{"text":"Detected SHA1 hash algorithm which is considered insecure. SHA1 is not collision resistant and is therefore not suitable as a cryptographic signature. Use SHA256 or SHA3 instead."},"properties":{},"ruleId":"python.lang.security.insecure-hash-algorithms.insecure-hash-algorithm-sha1"},{"fingerprints":{"matchBasedId/v1":"936b9a14cb5d60b29f8a0341939210804fa586dcab84f39d142dbe3899ecbe658f2ba218b0789193adfc07c60abe6e6f5057186c735b4e4d70e2e14de0978724_0"},"locations":[{"phy